	{
		{"text"},
		line=991,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"eval", exp="g.no221=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050190"},
		line=991,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, might I have a moment of your time?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Kotone hesitantly inquires from the other side of the screen door.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is anything the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone fidgets in place as her eyes dart about the room.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“N-No, nothing is the matter in particular... Incidentally, might Akari-sama be in her room at present?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, she's with Koyuzu right now.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Interesting, veeery interesting... Well, well, well...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"That's the face of someone up to no good.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What business do you have with me?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Er, I do not have any business in particular, but in a certain manner of speaking, perhaps I do...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Which is it?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I simply wished to talk with you for a short while.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In particular, about the occasion you became one with Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I've been meaning to bring that up with Kotone as well.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was all thanks to you, Kotone. Your quick thinking was what saved us all.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't thank you enough.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, not at all...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Kotone's cheeks flush red in response.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've been meaning to ask, though. What was it that you used to defeat Sekka?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I find myself wanting to know more and more about Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That was what is known as 'primeval magicks.'”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“An act of supplicating Oomikami with nothing more than your sincere prayer.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Until the Founding Empress's time, all of Oomikami's blessings came in this form.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did you pray for?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To strike down Sekka-san and save you and Akari-sama... That was all I could think about at the time.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I sympathized greatly with her plight, and my heart cried out for her suffering...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But even so... I could not bear the thought of losing all I hold dear.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With that sentiment in my heart, I made my prayer.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And the result was that divine light?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed. What I did to Sekka-san was truly unforgivable...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Even after being trampled and scorned by Sekka, Kotone still grieves for her and regrets the cruelty of the outcome that came to pass.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"This extraordinary compassion for others, this selfless regard for all things─it's what makes Kotone such a wonderful person.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think I understand why you were chosen as Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Truly?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have been told that my predecessor claimed I had 'the gift to love unconditionally...'”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's exactly it.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I also think you have that gift.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The Shiinoha Chihaya of Mitsurugi's memories─the very first Exalt-Priestess─possessed the same ingenuous, wholehearted love for all Oomikami's creation.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"She and Kotone have much in common.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... why might you be looking at me with that grin on your face?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I should think that you of all people ought to hold\nMitsurugi-sama's bride in higher esteem...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Kotone can sure be a real handful at times, but I think she's a lovely woman all the same.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh right, on the topic of Mitsurugi's bride...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When I was crossing blades with Kokuan-dono, an incredible power flooded into me all of a sudden. What was it that you did?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"According to Akari, Kotone apparently used Honing magicks on me.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Until that point, I had been treating you as a human and ministering you with spells of Healing.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But as it turns out, that was the wrong approach.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With the thought that Mitsurugi-sama was first and foremost the legendary blade Ame no Mitsurugi, I realized that you needed instead to be Honed.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I see. It all makes sense now.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kotone's explanation reconciles all the questions that have been floating around inside me.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I was always but a simple tool, nothing more and nothing less than the blade of my lord.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"If a warrior is the wielder of a blade, I am that blade itself.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama told me afterwards that once you were Honed, it was as though you truly were the Mitsurugi-sama of legend.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What was your experience of that?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At the time, I felt like a god of the blade.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"In that moment, I became an indominable avatar of war, possessed with such overwhelming power that I could defeat even Kokuan-dono with ease.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Taking on an entire division of Republican soldiers would have been but a paltry task.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, if we are ever faced with danger again, I shall be sure to Hone you at once.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No. I don't want you to Hone me ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-Whyever not?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"As soon as I became Mitsurugi, I could feel Kotone's soul inside me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"That can only be because when the Exalt-Priestess Hones Mitsurugi, it taxes her so greatly that it engraves her soul upon his.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Fortunately this time, Sekka was there to sever the connection between our souls, but if she hadn't, Kotone would surely have lost her life.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Because I don't want to lose you.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Wh-What might you mean by...”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Exactly what it sounds like.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"─No matter what, I don't want to lose Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I realized it for the first time when I saved her from that world of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"What I feel for her is completely different from what I feel for Akari. I don't just want to protect Kotone, I also want to─",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, may I ask you a question, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What sort of existence am I to you?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I'm not sure.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"This is not the first time I've felt this ache from deep within my chest.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"But it's an emotion I've sealed away all this time.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"So I have no idea how to put it into words.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would you like to learn more?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I, too, wish to understand better what you truly think of me.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How do you intend to do that?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why, it is a simple matter indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Kotone leans in towards me, close enough for our breaths to tickle each other.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Only then do I finally understand her intention.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait. We can't.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whyever not?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Her moist eyes fix me with a passionate gaze.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're a priestess. Your chastity is precious.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, that is indeed the case.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hence I would offer you this most precious possession of mine.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"The fact that Kotone feels this way fills me with joy.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"But despite that, my hesitation manages to win out.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, do you remember?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The very first thing you said to me when you awakened here in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That you owed your life to me, and that you would surely repay this debt of gratitude someday.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I did say that.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wish to claim my compensation here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Kotone brings her face even closer.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's only fair... But how should I repay you?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would be delighted to accept my repayment in the form of your body.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Th-Th-That came out wrong! I most certainly did not mean anything indecent by that!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Though at the same time, perhaps I did mean it indecently!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Calm down, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahem... I am calm now. Yes, calm I am.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"She sure doesn't look it.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, my heart yearns for you and you alone.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Should you not be opposed to it... I would very much like to receive the proof of your love...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"As for me, I'm overjoyed that Kotone thinks that about me.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"But still...",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. Can you give me some time to think about it?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You and I both do not know what tomorrow will bring for us, correct?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With that in mind, I insist on claiming my compensation here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Any chance you'll just give it up?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not in the slightest, no.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I know all too well that her forcefulness would not lose to even that of Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Kotone must have been determined to go through with this long before she knocked on my door.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I should respond to her resolve in kind.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...All right.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, will you give yourself over to me?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, gladly!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I take the beaming Kotone in my arms and hug her close to me.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Gently supporting her back, I lay Kotone down on my futon.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Her well-rounded breasts sway as she squirms beneath my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, is there anything you want me to do?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wish to be joined with you by the deepest of bonds.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, yeah, that's a given.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But is there anything more specific you're looking for?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"For some reason, Kotone awkwardly averts her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, as embarrassing as it is to admit, I am wholly ignorant in matters of intimacy...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And, um... I have never pleasured myself either, as it were...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Kotone confesses in a barely audible mumble.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Really?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was always somewhat interested, but it was expressly forbidden at the Imperial Seminary.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And after becoming Exalt-Priestess, I repeatedly admonished myself to not become distracted by lustful thoughts.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Her alluring body is still as chaste as the day she was born.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, you'll understand as soon as we get started.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“R-Right!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Kotone stammers, her body stiff as a board.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's gonna be okay. If it's uncomfortable for you at all, I'll stop right away.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You need not concern yourself over me. Everything is a valuable experience, as they say.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And more than anything else, I yearn to become one with you...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"That said, Kotone has essentially no knowledge about how to proceed.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"I'll need to take the lead.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, stay just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, absolutely.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“So, what will we be doing first?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll start with a kiss.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, yes!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Wait─a whaaat?! You would consent to do that with someone like me?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes go wide.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I can't help but crack a smile that she's still so flustered about a kiss after having come this far.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I should be asking you that. Are you really sure you want me for your first kiss?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would offer my absolute everything to you, so please do not concern yourself with that.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I'm only doing this because I want all of you.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So please stop questioning whether you're good enough for me.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You aren't the only one whose heart is racing right now.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"For the first time since we've begun, Kotone finally relaxes her tensed shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"A lovely smile crosses her face, and a faint blush begins to tinge her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I understand, Soujin-sama... I am all yours...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnmmh...”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Kotone parts her lips ever so slightly, like a baby chick begging to be fed.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Her tiny lips quiver as she squeezes her eyes tightly shut.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Taken in by her adorably clumsy mannerisms, I bring my face close to hers.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnm... *smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Her peach-pink lips lightly brush against my own.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I've just made mine this part of her body that has never known the touch of another man.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahn, mwah, fwaamh...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"As our lips part, Kotone peers up at me with hazy eyes swimming with passion.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Kissing you... is like a dream come true...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Our very first kiss leaves her gasping for breath.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"I trace my finger over the contour of her lips, wiping away the mess we made.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How was that, Kotone? Do you like kissing?”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do... My head goes all foggy as though I have a fever, and my body feels like it is going to burn up...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But it is a most pleasant heat, as though you are wrapping all of me up in your warmth...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Er... I think I might really like kissing...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Kotone bashfully declares as she blushes up to her ears.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"She must think what she just admitted was terribly indecent.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is what intimacy between men and women is like.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I never imagined it might feel this good...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Kotone whispers, still trying to catch her breath.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"But her labored breaths soon turn into wistful sighs.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But... as soon as you back away, I feel this deep aching in my chest.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I want you to touch me... more and more...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Kotone seemingly reaches an epiphany as she confesses her yearning.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, so this must be why men and women who are in love often lose themselves in each other's arms.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I can certainly see... how alluring such a prospect might be.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But we still have much more ahead of us... do we not?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"She peers up at me, her eyes filled with equal parts trepidation and anticipation.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I hope that will we have a wonderful family together, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, me too.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But that said, Soujin-sama and my child... Ehehee, I would quite like to see that someday.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Perhaps imagining what our child's face might look like,\nKotone's face is plastered with a blissful grin.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But... I believe we can put that off for a little while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I still wish to see our love blossom further... just the two of us.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's good, too.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Bringing my face close to my lovely Kotone, I steal away her lips.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahhnn, Soujin-sama, haahh... fwahnn...”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
